            "review_title": "Review at Gemination Bà Nà Eatery & Bar",
            "review_text": "Xmd914\nLondon, United Kingdom90 contributions\n0\nThis is a Gem at Ba Na Hills!\nSep 2026 • Family\nSpent my 50th Birthday supper here last 14 September 2026! I was with my best friend and Mum. Best decision ever! Excellent food and drinks! Superb service! Cheers to all the kind and accomodating staff!\nThe last time I had a proper Negroni was before pandemic at The River Cafe, Fulham, London. Many thanks, Tau for making my birthday drink- Best Negroni in Asia! 💜 Special mention to Jack for my birthday candle on the Crème brulée and the rest of the staff for the birthday song! Hehe! Truly appreciate it! We felt so at home here! 💜\nOh, my Mum is on a wheelchair. They helped me and adjusted the tables.\nHighly recommended to dine and chill in Ba Na Hills! 💜\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
