            "review_title": "Review at Gemination Bà Nà Eatery & Bar",
            "review_text": "Bethany Partridge\n11 contributions\n0\nA Michelin-Level Surprise in Ba Na Hills - worth leaving the hotel for!\nJan 2026 • Couples\nSo glad we chose to explore rather than just eat at the hotel during our stay in Ba Na Hills! The restaurant has a beautiful, intimate setting, great music, and the most attentive staff.\n\nThere were two lagers on draft (1664 and Carlsberg) at 89k each, and we opted for a fantastic deal: two main meals and two beers for 500k, which felt very reasonable for Ba Na Hills. The menu had plenty of choice, but Hoai Boa helped us decide — and we’re so glad we listened!\n\nThe wagyu beef burger was, without question, the best burger we’ve ever had. We followed it with desserts, and honestly, it felt like dining at a Michelin-star establishment.\n\nHoai Boa was the loveliest, smiliest person and made sure every detail of our visit was flawless. You won’t regret eating here!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 7, 2026",
