            "review_title": "Review at Gemination Bà Nà Eatery & Bar",
            "review_text": "Sharon L\n2 contributions\n0\nA must-do experience - food and drinks are insane!!!\nAug 2025 • Family\nThe food and drinks are literally the best we have had our entire trip to Hoi An / DaNang. We ordered gin fizz, martinis as well as beef burger, calamari, steak, crab linguini and prawn with chorizo dish. Everything was insanely delicious. And the staff - my goodness, I asked if they owned the place, that’s how much passion, friendliness and professionalism they had. Hoai Bao was our runner (love him!!) and Minh Ngoc the supervisor and cocktail extraordinaire. An absolute must-do experience. Cannot rate it highly enough!! ❤️❤️❤️\nRead more\nWritten August 7, 2025",
